# Files that decide what the privileged Netlify build executes. Netlify runs the
# build command from the built revision, so changes here change code execution in
# the deploy environment and need an explicit maintainer approval.
# The enforced surface list is scripts/build-surface.mjs; this file is the
# broader review set and must stay a superset of it.
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @qiffang @srstack
/.github/workflows/         @qiffang @srstack
/netlify.toml               @qiffang @srstack
/site/netlify.toml          @qiffang @srstack
/site/package.json          @qiffang @srstack
/site/package-lock.json     @qiffang @srstack
/package.json               @qiffang @srstack
/package-lock.json          @qiffang @srstack
/scripts/                   @qiffang @srstack
/vendor/studio-build.json   @qiffang @srstack
